                            	    71: ; FIX v490: Sprite tile copies live at VRAM $4000-$7FFF (tiles 512-1023)
                            	    72: ; These copies have pixel values shifted +4 so sprites use palette colors 4-7
                            	    73: SPRITE_TILE_VRAM_BASE   EQU $4000
